#title: BT-196(BT-709)-LotResult
#description: The corresponding XML element is /*/ext:UBLExtensions/ext:UBLExtension/ext:ExtensionContent/efext:EformsExtension/efac:NoticeResult/efac:LotResult/efac:FrameworkAgreementValues/efac:FieldsPrivacy[efbc:FieldIdentifierCode/text()='max-val']/efbc:ReasonDescription. 
